  {
   "id": "ghetto-zombies-graffiti-squad-255711@5.0.4",
   "gameId": "ghetto-zombies-graffiti-squad-255711",
   "displayName": "Patch 5.0.4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-17T14:04:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We launched the game yesterday, and we’re already very excited to share our first bug fix update! 🚀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since launch, the community has started sending feedback and reports — and that made a huge difference for us to act quickly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition to the improvements shown in the image, this patch also includes other important fixes, such as:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a softlock that occurred when dying during the Boss fight, which previously could only be resolved by reloading the save",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a softlock that occurred when returning to HQ without picking up the backpack drop containing the gate key",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improvements to achievement localization for languages other than Brazilian Portuguese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re really happy to be able to release this update so early and we truly appreciate everyone who has already started sending bug reports, suggestions, and feedback 🙌",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉 Please keep sending your reports!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They help us fix issues, continuously improve the experience, and make the game better together with the community.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
